%% theme=default font=15
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor E as Employee
  participant W as Web layer<br/>(route)
  participant S as IncidentService
  participant I as Incident<br/>(domain)
  participant R as Repositories
  participant O as Observers<br/>(audit, notification)

  E->>W: submit the report form
  W->>W: guard: signed in as employee
  W->>S: create_incident(actor, request)
  S->>S: validate the request and the actor
  S->>R: load service and category
  S->>R: same reporter, title and service<br/>in the last 10 minutes?
  S->>I: build Incident (status NEW)
  S->>S: priority strategy gives P1 to P4 and score,<br/>SLA policy gives the deadlines
  S->>R: save (gets id and INC number)
  S->>O: attach observers, record_creation
  O->>R: audit record, notify reporter<br/>and administrators
  S->>S: duplicate detector compares with open<br/>incidents on the same service (flag only)
  S->>I: classify (system): NEW to CLASSIFIED
  S->>R: save
  S->>S: assignment strategy chooses a technician
  S->>I: assign_to: CLASSIFIED to ASSIGNED
  I->>O: event
  O->>R: audit record, notify technician and reporter
  S->>R: save
  S-->>W: the incident
  W-->>E: redirect to the incident page<br/>with confirmation messages
